{"about_the_game":"<strong><i>Reflecting Reflections</i></strong> is a combination of Real Time Strategy, Wave Defense and Puzzle Solving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824220/extras/f8f3445da08194ef9724fb1206702ec2.avif?t=1584399036\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824220/extras/8b95e3909636cd1eac357eb335eea970.avif?t=1584399036\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><strong>Collect</strong> - Gather Sticks, Stones, and Silver from the Trees, Rocks and the wandering Wanderers.<br><br><strong>Prepare</strong> - Command your Attackers and place your Defenders while you await the upcoming battle.<br><br><strong>Destroy</strong> - Send your Attackers toward the Enemy, eliminate the Enemy's base and capture their Star.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824220/extras/0712d40d967eb6c542bc460425010169.avif?t=1584399036\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><strong>Fortify</strong> - Scout the map and position your Defenders accordingly.<br><br><strong>Protect</strong> - Stop the hundreds of Attackers from overwhelming your base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824220/extras/2f3667ce9f164480cf84ab1d74945f10.avif?t=1584399036\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><strong>Explore</strong> - Use your reflect ability to quickly navigate around the map. Spin and Track your movement to unlock new locations. Stay alive under the pressures of many Attackers and Defenders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824220/extras/818e82a273dba0aec6e830ebda9c457b.avif?t=1584399036\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><strong>Something for Everyone</strong> - 3 distinct modes that offer new ways to play.<br><br><strong>Many Explosions</strong> - Watch 1000's of Attackers and Defenders explode.<br><br><strong>Never Stuck</strong> - Can't beat a level, skip it. There is no requirement to complete a level to unlock the next and each mode can be played independently.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"29de4345aa510a8616dea5775da4c1e9a56fadaa.jpg","localized_name":"Get Destroyed","name":"Get Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/29de4345aa510a8616dea5775da4c1e9a56fadaa.jpg"},{"icon":"c9ab5c0ae2cd8c5ac131a094650e7077b2d445e3.jpg","localized_name":"Winning is Fun","name":"Winning is Fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/c9ab5c0ae2cd8c5ac131a094650e7077b2d445e3.jpg"},{"icon":"0c41ef849f85fb4e1ceb7bd3c552a9d72b252370.jpg","localized_name":"Completionist","name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/0c41ef849f85fb4e1ceb7bd3c552a9d72b252370.jpg"},{"icon":"c3d6dc7136090fe814f64e40b15ef2c54a1c28ac.jpg","localized_name":"Patience and Perseverance","name":"Patience and Perseverance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/c3d6dc7136090fe814f64e40b15ef2c54a1c28ac.jpg"},{"icon":"a70e3bbce5a0e36f958e4000a9a65251d81b7457.jpg","localized_name":"Banked Up Resources","name":"Banked Up Resources","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/a70e3bbce5a0e36f958e4000a9a65251d81b7457.jpg"},{"icon":"0559bb83e693e5cc54bee48d1be3650f601d9e69.jpg","localized_name":"1 v 1 Me","name":"1 v 1 Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/824220/0559bb83e693e5cc54bee48d1be3650f601d9e69.jpg"},{"icon":"d8f6d7bf3130fefb9ab78317cddfbea06f8c0029.jpg","localized_name":"Limited Reflections","name":"Limited Reflectio